<section class="two-column section-rule">
  <div><h2>Using AI tools</h2><p>Document substantial AI assistance and review generated work before submitting it.</p></div>
  <div><h2>Responsible use</h2><p>Do not enter confidential material, credentials, or private project data into external services without permission.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="section-rule">
  <h2>Assignment extensions</h2>
  <p>Each student has a total allowance of three additional days to extend assignment deadlines.</p>
  <div class="facts-box">
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Total allowance</dt><dd>3 days across all assignments</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Distribution</dt><dd>Split across any assignments in any proportion</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Request by</dt><dd>The original deadline of the assignment</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Applies to</dt><dd>Assignments only, not course projects</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <ul class="plain-list">
    <li>The cumulative extension across all assignments must not exceed three days.</li>
    <li>To use an extension, fill out the extension request form before the assignment's original deadline. Requests submitted after the original deadline will not be considered under this policy.</li>
    <li>All course project deadlines remain unchanged.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="notice">Plan your submissions so that the total extension you use stays within the permitted limit.</p>
</section>

